---
layout: layouts/base.webc
title: "Projects"
description: "Products Ming Liang has shipped recently — from game experiments and AI tooling to practical everyday tools."
---

<div class="flex flex-col gap-12">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 motion-rise">
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-black tracking-tighter leading-none">Projects</h1>
    <p class="text-base font-light text-base-content/60 max-w-lg motion-fade motion-delay-1">
      Products I have shipped recently, from game experiments to practical tools
      that solve everyday problems.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-col">
    <hr class="border-base-content/10" />

    <article webc:for="project, index of projects" class="py-10 border-b border-base-content/10 motion-rise">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-6 sm:gap-10">
        <span
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-thin text-base-content/50 leading-none select-none shrink-0 w-12 sm:w-16"
          @text="String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')"
        ></span>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 flex-1 min-w-0">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between gap-4 sm:gap-8">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight" @text="project.title"></h2>
              <p class="text-base text-base-content/60 max-w-prose" @text="project.description"></p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap sm:flex-col gap-x-4 gap-y-2 shrink-0 sm:text-right">
              <a
                webc:for="link, linkIndex of project.links"
                :href="link.url"
                :target="link.url.startsWith('http') ? '_blank' : undefined"
                :rel="link.url.startsWith('http') ? 'noopener noreferrer' : undefined"
                :class="linkIndex === 0 ? 'text-sm text-primary hover:underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-200 no-underline' : 'text-sm text-base-content/65 hover:text-base-content hover:underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-200 no-underline'"
              >
                <span @text="link.label"></span>
                <span>↗</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span
              webc:for="tag of project.tags"
              class="text-xs font-mono text-base-content/65 border border-base-content/15 px-2 py-0.5 rounded"
              @text="tag"
            ></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</div>
